024"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "screenshot_2.png", "id": "1740232476561271", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392000_1740232479894604_1157582874974344537_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZjkrEE_ixWkQ7kNvwGs-2ui&_nc_oc=AdpcuR8VPRcrQ0ap4fcQBrl9L0k4mVa0ODGWNpqrLoNhb_gyYyn-O41eWi1ZHVDaNtU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFS2wDnEwiUj2XLJ9B0pXMN78tf9xs8nKNkKV6tTRPVMQ&oe=6A859686"}, "display_name": "JobVRiety - the Careers Adventure Park", "keywords": ["Training", "Professions", "Careers", "Job", "apprenticeship"], "long_description": "Experience career orientation in a whole new way with jobVRiety: In this interactive Career Adventure Park, you can playfully explore different professions and try out your first job-related tasks. Whether technology, healthcare, or skilled trades \u2013 find out what excites you most! \ud83d\ude80\n\n# Discover Professions\n- Optician\n- Retail Salesperson\n- Electronics Technician \u2013 Automation Technology\n- Mechatronics Technician \u2013 Refrigeration Technology\n\n# Features\n-  Interactive Career Park with mini-games\n- Explore various industries in a colorful environment \ud83c\udfa2\n- Virtual Internship: Take on real tasks from different professions and experience playful learning \ud83e\udde0\n- Intuitive VR Controls \u2013 Easy navigation and interaction \ud83d\udd79\n- German speech + subtitels in English for international Users", "short_description": "Experience career orientation in a whole new way with jobVRiety: In this interactive career adventure park, you can playfully explore various professions (optician, retail salesperson, electronics technician - automation technology, mechatronics technician - refrigeration technology) and try out typical job tasks. Whether it's technology, healthcare, or skilled trades \u2013 find out what you like most! \ud83d\ude80"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv